corresponding to the spaces%
\begin{align}
V  &  =\mathbb{R}-\operatorname*{linspan}\left\{  f_{1}^{d},f_{2}^{d}\right\}
=\mathbb{R}-\operatorname*{linspan}\left\{  \left(
